# ============================================================================
# ROUTE 30, expanded  (20x40 blocks, buffer 1196/1300; this repo's 13x27)
# Source: route30_base.amap (hand grid); this file = rough.py --seed 5 --p 0.55
# ============================================================================
# KEPT: the single-lane west road from Cherrygrove (S) to Route 31 (N), with
#   path ledges (56) you hop going south and walk round going north; Joey
#   and his Rattata near the Cherrygrove end; the Berry House beside its pond;
#   the Mr. Pokemon detour branching NE from a signed junction; the wild
#   tall-grass lane on the east side; Kimono Girl Hana's flower spot; the
#   SE pond; fruit trees, Antidote, Full Heal, hidden Potion and Lure Ball.
# ADDED (cf. pokefollow Route 1 / Route 2):
#   Mr. Pokemon's hilltop: a plateau behind a ledge, reached only by the
#     branch path, with his own pond, flower beds and a winding drive.
#   Berry House garden: a fenced plot (48-4a) of fruit trees; the berry man's
#     house is now the log-cabin style (2c-2f).
#   East wild lane: a long tall-grass corridor between stands of wood,
#     opening at the junction (N) and the pond (S).
#   Hana's glade: a tree-ringed flower clearing (Leafeon trainer).
#   Three ledge-terraced meadows east of the road (one-way hops south).
# CONNECTIONS: N col 3 (steps 6-7) -> Route 31 S edge; S col 3 -> Cherrygrove
#   N avenue (expanded cols 13-14): needs a new connection offset.
# ============================================================================
ref Route30
key 1=14 2=15 c=2c d=2d e=2e f=2f q=48 w=49 p=4a
key !=3c ?=3d @=3e $=3f &=64 +=62 |=60 <=5d >=5e %=61 /=5c
grid:
TTT.,TTTTTTTTTTTTTTT
TT,.,,"TTT(^^),,*,TT
